description: Public surface design language
globs: ["app/routes/public/**", "app/layouts/public-layout.tsx", "app/ui/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---

Direction is "Measure" — docs/DESIGN_DIRECTION.md, governed by
docs/REFERENCE_LOCK.md. Precedent: `app/routes/public/home.tsx`.

- Rules, not cards. A bordered box needs a reason beyond grouping.
- Sections open on a hairline with a serif numeral and a sentence-case
  `label-micro`. **Never all-caps Vietnamese.**
- Display type is Newsreader at weight 300–400. Weight is not how importance is
  signalled; scale, rule and space are.
- Every comparable number goes through `<Figures>`.
- One chromatic mark (`lacquer`), one dominant CTA per page.
- Long-form text is capped by the `measure` utility.
- Photography is `<ArtDirectedImage>` with a brief in
  `app/content/photography.ts`. If a layout needs a photo to look finished, the
  layout is wrong.
- Unknown studio facts use `<PendingFact>`. Never invent an address, price,
  phone number, testimonial, rating or trainer biography.

Banned: pills, gradients, glassmorphism, decorative shadow, emoji iconography,
card-grid section rhythm, a second icon family, stock photography.
